  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">224166_DEC Middle East Humanitarian Appeal-West Bank Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Vision Jerusalem West Bank Gaza (WV JWG) will continue to deliver an integrated, community-based programme that to strengthen protection and address urgent health needs, enhancing community resilience and emergency response preparedness through disaster risk reduction (DRR) and providing safe, community spaces for children, youth and adults for delivering humanitarian assistance, recovery and development initiatives across the Nexus.
 
 The phase 2 programme will start in May, and the budget will be allocated 50% to WV JWG(West Bank).
 
 Currently, WVJWG had a brainstorming session to discuss potential ideas for phase 2. The team is considering the activities below:
 
 1. Multisectoral: Protective community spaces(supporting localisation &amp; local response, safe space for planning/preparedness, humanitarian distribution &amp; service delivery recovery initiatives)
 
 2. Health: Supporting Public Health Clinics in Hebron&amp;Bethlehem with life-saving medical equipment &amp; supplies.
 
 3. DRR: Provision of life-saving DRR tools &amp; training to support local Civil Defence actors in Nothern &amp; Central West Bank</narrative>
  </description>
